CONTEXT TooEarly INCLUDES Kurk FROM "../contexts/kurk_existing.adl" AS old,
                          Kurk FROM "../contexts/kurk_desired.adl" AS new
CONTEXT TooEarly IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT TooEarly
{+ The desired system of the migration case is included with its blocking invariant
while the violations have not been repaired: a2 and a3 are paired with no B.
The compiler refuses this, which is why a migration needs an intermediate system. +}


CLASSIFY old.A ISA new.A
CLASSIFY old.B ISA new.B

POPULATION new.r[new.A*new.B] CONTAINS [ ("a1", "b1") ]

ENDCONTEXT
